PS5 HDMI: more modes, no switches

100 Hz (1080p100, 1440p100, 4K100 over FRL) and 1440p120 on both chips, within the display's limits.
FLAVA3 also takes every other progressive timing up to 600 MHz through the bridge's manual setup
(index 0x05 and its timing registers, from rmux's tree); VERDE keeps to the bridge's own setups.
